00:05:20.843 --> 00:05:22.770
I don't feel ready to direct something.

00:05:22.770 --> 00:05:24.920
I'd like to direct, but if I did it,

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:26.630
I'd wanna be ready to do it.

00:05:26.630 --> 00:05:29.350
I really like the idea of
